<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1739779101"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:35.948"><div begin="5.430" end="35.154" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="5.430" end="12.774" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.430" end="5.953">冬</span><span begin="5.953" end="7.101">季</span><span begin="7.221" end="8.328">过得不容</span><span begin="8.328" end="8.754">易</span> <span begin="9.362" end="9.948">逃</span><span begin="9.948" end="10.885">避</span><span begin="11.136" end="12.224">与你的回</span><span begin="12.224" end="12.774">忆</span></p><p begin="13.190" end="19.408" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.190" end="13.860">你</span><span begin="13.860" end="14.702">的</span><span begin="14.973" end="15.803">香水味</span><span begin="15.803" end="16.329">还留</span><span begin="16.329" end="16.825">在</span><span begin="16.825" end="17.094">我</span><span begin="17.094" end="18.099">房间</span><span begin="18.099" end="19.408">里</span></p><p begin="20.990" end="28.635" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.990" end="21.666">夏</span><span begin="21.666" end="22.784">季</span><span begin="22.892" end="24.044">躺在我怀</span><span begin="24.044" end="24.493">里</span> <span begin="25.103" end="25.553">哭</span><span begin="25.553" end="26.695">泣</span><span begin="26.902" end="27.931">怀里不是</span><span begin="27.931" end="28.635">你</span></p><p begin="28.950" end="35.154" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.950" end="29.575">今</span><span begin="29.575" end="30.686">夜</span><span begin="30.880" end="31.580">又是谁</span><span begin="31.580" end="32.105">出现</span><span begin="32.105" end="32.578">在</span><span begin="32.578" end="32.845">我</span><span begin="32.845" end="33.787">房间</span><span begin="33.787" end="35.154">里</span></p></div><div begin="37.560" end="50.458" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="37.560" end="42.823" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.560" end="39.990">甜蜜的过去最终变成</span><span begin="39.990" end="40.495">苦</span><span begin="40.495" end="40.879">涩</span><span begin="40.879" end="41.873">的泪</span><span begin="41.873" end="42.823">滴</span></p><p begin="43.350" end="50.458" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.350" end="44.001">讨厌</span><span begin="44.001" end="44.444">我</span><span begin="44.444" end="44.746">自</span><span begin="44.746" end="45.211">己</span> <span begin="45.362" end="45.752">怎</span><span begin="45.752" end="46.429">么</span><span begin="46.429" end="46.766">无</span><span begin="46.766" end="47.783">法忘</span><span begin="47.783" end="50.458">记</span></p></div><div begin="51.400" end="1:28.090" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="51.400" end="58.270" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.400" end="51.819">朋</span><span begin="51.819" end="52.264">友</span><span begin="52.264" end="52.498">都</span><span begin="52.498" end="53.036">说</span> <span begin="53.304" end="53.614">爱</span><span begin="53.614" end="54.302">笑</span><span begin="54.302" end="54.561">的</span><span begin="54.561" end="54.996">我</span> <span begin="55.494" end="55.744">冷</span><span begin="55.744" end="56.719">笑话</span><span begin="56.719" end="57.213">有</span><span begin="57.213" end="57.482">点</span><span begin="57.482" end="58.270">多</span></p><p begin="58.410" end="1:06.000" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.410" end="59.416">从不</span><span begin="59.416" end="1:00.017">想</span><span begin="1:00.017" end="1:00.368">太</span><span begin="1:00.368" end="1:00.914">多</span> <span begin="1:01.220" end="1:01.552">就</span><span begin="1:01.552" end="1:02.081">简</span><span begin="1:02.081" end="1:02.391">单</span><span begin="1:02.391" end="1:02.970">的</span> <span begin="1:03.045" end="1:03.669">总说</span><span begin="1:03.669" end="1:03.989">无</span><span begin="1:03.989" end="1:04.411">所</span><span begin="1:04.411" end="1:04.916">谓</span><span begin="1:04.916" end="1:05.235">的</span><span begin="1:05.235" end="1:06.000">我</span></p><p begin="1:06.010" end="1:14.740" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.010" end="1:07.493">何谓寂</span><span begin="1:07.493" end="1:09.141">寞</span> <span begin="1:09.252" end="1:09.576">漂</span><span begin="1:09.576" end="1:10.826">泊</span> <span begin="1:10.947" end="1:11.410">总不</span><span begin="1:11.410" end="1:11.883">会</span><span begin="1:11.883" end="1:12.170">觉</span><span begin="1:12.170" end="1:13.236">得难</span><span begin="1:13.236" end="1:14.740">过</span></p><p begin="1:14.750" end="1:20.062" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.750" end="1:15.476">没错</span><span begin="1:15.476" end="1:15.857">那</span><span begin="1:15.857" end="1:16.195">是</span><span begin="1:16.195" end="1:16.693">我</span> <span begin="1:16.881" end="1:17.406">遇上</span><span begin="1:17.406" end="1:17.879">你</span><span begin="1:17.879" end="1:18.098">之</span><span begin="1:18.098" end="1:18.896">前</span><span begin="1:18.896" end="1:19.141">的</span><span begin="1:19.141" end="1:20.062">我</span></p><p begin="1:22.520" end="1:28.090" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.520" end="1:23.294">遇上</span><span begin="1:23.294" end="1:24.237">你</span><span begin="1:24.237" end="1:26.138">之前</span><span begin="1:26.209" end="1:27.160">的</span><span begin="1:27.160" end="1:28.090">我</span></p></div><div begin="1:31.460" end="1:47.581" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:31.460" end="1:35.240" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.460" end="1:33.084">重温当天的照</span><span begin="1:33.084" end="1:33.350">片</span> <span begin="1:33.350" end="1:34.840">我继续活在过</span><span begin="1:34.840" end="1:35.240">去</span></p><p begin="1:35.390" end="1:39.320" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.390" end="1:37.262">可笑的是这回忆</span> <span begin="1:37.262" end="1:38.529">对我来说是</span><span begin="1:38.529" end="1:38.846">地</span><span begin="1:38.846" end="1:39.320">狱</span></p><p begin="1:39.360" end="1:43.100" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.360" end="1:41.703">你的香水像是毒药般</span> <span begin="1:41.703" end="1:42.178">我慢</span><span begin="1:42.178" end="1:42.699">慢睡</span><span begin="1:42.699" end="1:43.100">去</span></p><p begin="1:43.220" end="1:47.581" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.220" end="1:44.875">当天从没想过</span> <span begin="1:44.875" end="1:46.371">照片里的爱难</span><span begin="1:46.371" end="1:46.662">再</span><span begin="1:46.662" end="1:47.581">续</span></p></div><div begin="1:48.290" end="2:01.120" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:48.290" end="1:53.553" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.290" end="1:50.849">甜蜜的过去最终变成</span><span begin="1:50.849" end="1:51.373">苦</span><span begin="1:51.373" end="1:51.660">涩</span><span begin="1:51.660" end="1:52.603">的泪</span><span begin="1:52.603" end="1:53.553">滴</span></p><p begin="1:53.990" end="2:01.120" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.990" end="1:54.756">讨厌</span><span begin="1:54.756" end="1:55.278">我</span><span begin="1:55.278" end="1:55.548">自</span><span begin="1:55.548" end="1:56.037">己</span> <span begin="1:56.235" end="1:56.591">始</span><span begin="1:56.591" end="1:57.216">终</span><span begin="1:57.279" end="1:57.592">还</span><span begin="1:57.592" end="1:58.498">爱着</span><span begin="1:58.498" end="2:01.120">你</span></p></div><div begin="2:01.130" end="2:30.862" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:01.130" end="2:09.350" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.130" end="2:02.486">我的朋</span><span begin="2:02.486" end="2:03.048">友</span><span begin="2:03.048" end="2:03.339">都</span><span begin="2:03.339" end="2:03.940">说</span> <span begin="2:04.111" end="2:04.413">爱</span><span begin="2:04.413" end="2:05.095">笑</span><span begin="2:05.095" end="2:05.375">的</span><span begin="2:05.375" end="2:05.945">我</span> <span begin="2:06.188" end="2:06.590">冷</span><span begin="2:06.590" end="2:07.523">笑话</span><span begin="2:07.523" end="2:08.045">有</span><span begin="2:08.045" end="2:08.306">点</span><span begin="2:08.306" end="